OpenMCX modifications of OpenAirInterface CN5G
==============================================

This directory and the images openmcx/oai-amf:mcx-n5, openmcx/oai-pcf:mcx-n5, openmcx/oai-smf:mcx-n5 and
openmcx/oai-upf:mcx-n5 contain OAI CN5G network functions (OpenAirInterface Software Alliance, https://github.com/OPENAIRINTERFACE: oai-cn5g-amf, oai-cn5g-pcf, oai-cn5g-smf, oai-cn5g-upf), version v2.2.1,
modified by OpenMCX for tutorial 3 (TS 29.514 Npcf_PolicyAuthorization from the MCPTT server as AF).

